---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Book a discovery call · Best Case Studio"
  description="Book a free 30-minute discovery call with Best Case Studio. Remote. No hard sell, no pitch deck."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
    { name: 'Contact', url: '/contact/' },
  ]}
>
  <section class="contact">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head">
        <p class="eyebrow mono">Let's make <span class="yelhl">things happen</span></p>
        <h1>
          Book a <em>discovery call</em>.
        </h1>
        <p class="lede">
          30 minutes, remote, free. We talk through your customers, your sales motion, and whether case studies are the right move for you right now. <em>Zero pitch.</em>
        </p>
        <p class="sub">Or skip the call and email <a href="mailto:jon@bestcasestud.io?subject=Discovery%20call">jon@bestcasestud.io</a>. We aim to reply within one business day.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="booking">
        <div class="meta">
          <div class="row"><span class="k">Duration</span><span class="v">30 minutes</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="k">Format</span><span class="v">Remote · video call</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="k">Cost</span><span class="v"><em>Free</em></span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="k">Pitch level</span><span class="v">Zero</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="k">Output</span><span class="v">An honest answer</span></div>
          <div class="row last"><span class="k">Or email</span><span class="v"><a href="mailto:jon@bestcasestud.io?subject=Discovery%20call">jon@bestcasestud.io</a></span></div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="calendly-inline-widget"
          data-url="https://calendly.com/thatwriterjon/best-case-studio"
          aria-label="Calendly scheduling widget"
        ></div>
        <noscript>
          <p class="noscript-fallback">
            JavaScript is needed to load the booking widget. <a href="https://calendly.com/thatwriterjon/best-case-studio">Open the Calendly page directly</a> or email <a href="mailto:jon@bestcasestud.io">jon@bestcasestud.io</a>.
          </p>
        </noscript>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="what-happens">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cols">
        <div>
          <h2>What happens on the call.</h2>
          <ol>
            <li>You tell us about a customer or two you'd want featured, and why.</li>
            <li>We ask the questions that decide whether a case study is the right move for you right now — or whether something else would serve you better.</li>
            <li>If it's a fit, we walk through the process, timeline, and how the customer interview works.</li>
            <li>If it isn't a fit, we say so on the call. No follow-up sequence.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>Who this isn't for.</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Pre-product-market-fit startups without paying customers yet.</li>
            <li>Companies who want anonymous, persona-style case studies. We only produce named-customer stories.</li>
            <li>Anyone looking for AI-generated content. Every word and every cut is ours.</li>
            <li>Teams without a customer success or sales contact who can introduce us to the customer.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script is:inline src="https://assets.calendly.com/assets/external/widget.js" async></script>
</Base>

<style>
  .contact {
    background: var(--bg);
    padding: 160px 0 120px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .head {
    max-width: 880px;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 96px);
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    max-width: 16ch;
  }
  h1 em {
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .sub {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 56ch;
    margin: 16px 0 0;
  }
  .sub a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .yelhl {
    background: var(--yellow);
    color: var(--ink);
    padding: 0 0.12em 0.04em;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    max-width: 56ch;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .lede em {
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .booking {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: start;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
    padding-top: 48px;
  }
  .meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    position: sticky;
    top: 96px;
  }
  .row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding-top: 12px;
  }
  .row:first-child {
    border-top: none;
    padding-top: 0;
  }
  .row .k {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .row .v {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .row .v em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--pink);
  }
  .row.last .v a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .calendly-inline-widget {
    min-width: 320px;
    /* Calendly's inline widget renders to whatever height the container gives it (the iframe
       doesn't auto-resize), so size it generously enough that the date picker, time slots,
       and confirmation step all fit without an inner scrollbar on a typical desktop. */
    height: 1080px;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    background: var(--bg);
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .calendly-inline-widget {
      height: 1240px;
    }
  }
  .noscript-fallback {
    padding: 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    background: var(--bg-2);
  }
  .noscript-fallback a {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .booking {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }
    .meta {
      position: static;
    }
  }

  .what-happens {
    background: var(--bg-2, var(--bg));
    padding: 96px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .what-happens .cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 64px;
  }
  .what-happens h2 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 40px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  .what-happens ol,
  .what-happens ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }
  .what-happens li {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    max-width: 56ch;
  }
  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .what-happens .cols {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
    }
  }
</style>
